@SeoAuto.AuditService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5002
@ApiGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:8000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Ping Check
GET {{SeoAuto.AuditService_HostAddress}}/api/audits/ping
Accept: text/plain

### 2. Ping via Gateway
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/audits/ping
Accept: text/plain

### 3. Submit Audit Request (via Gateway)
POST {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/audits/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://google.com",
  "strategy": "Desktop"
}

### 4. Get Audit Detail By Id (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/audits/YOUR_AUDIT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get My Audits History (via Gateway)
GET {{ApiGateway_HostAddress}}/api/audits/my?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

